    <name>pdo_tidb</name>
    <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
    <summary>PDO driver for TiDB</summary>
    <description>Native PDO driver for TiDB. The MySQL protocol is implemented in Rust against TiDB's behaviour and linked through a C ABI: TiDB authentication plugins (tidb_sm3_password, caching_sha2_password, LDAP SASL, tokens), TLS through rustls, zlib and zstd compression, server-side cursors, TiDB error classes for retries, host failover and a Pdo\Tidb subclass. Building requires Rust 1.88 or newer (cargo on PATH), or a prebuilt libtidb_ffi.a passed with --with-tidb-ffi.</description>
